WEBVTT

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:41.350
Dynazenon... What exactly are you?

00:01:41.350 --> 00:01:45.190
Before we're beat,
show us what you're made of!

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:52.650
D... y... n... a... R... e... x...?

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:56.270
Huh?

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:13.270
Th-That stopped it!

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:18.400
Is this Dynazenon's true power?! Dyna Rex!

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:37.600
Blazing Inferno Rex Roar!

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:44.980
What... just happened?

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.480
Minami, you okay?!

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:08.690
What's this?

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:14.980
It vanished!

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:22.350
It can go back to being small?

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:27.150
It's thanks to you guys
we beat that <i>kaiju</i> . Thanks.

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:30.150
Huh? But I didn't do anything.

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:36.270
Actually, it's possible that Dynazenon
recognized your aptitude.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:40.650
Thank goodness!
You're not dead after all, Senpai!

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:41.940
Oh, Chise.

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:44.270
Where'd the big robot go?

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:46.160
I guess it shrunk.

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:46.770
Where's your umbrella, Minami?

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:48.270
--Huh? Shrunk?
--What?

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:49.560
--Hell no.
--Huh?

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:52.770
You! Apologize to Yomogi!

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:56.100
What the hell?! You were about to leave!

00:03:56.100 --> 00:04:00.150
Apologize for breaking
your promise with Yomogi!

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:00.550
Wednesday, May 27

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:00.550
Wednesday, May 27

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:02.730
Just forget it!

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:04.190
Why?!

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:07.480
'Cuz it hardly matters right now.

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:11.900
What are we talking about?

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:14.190
Huh? Who are you?

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.810
Koyomi Yamanaka.

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:20.690
I'm Chise Asukagawa. We're cousins.

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:26.150
I'm Gauma. And you? What's your name?

00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:28.690
Yume Minami.

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:32.150
Just chill out, okay?

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:37.100
Anyway, what's this about
<i>kaiju</i> and Dynazenon?

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:39.940
That <i>kaiju</i> was being controlled.

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:44.650
Probably by the Kaiju Eugenicists,
a dangerous crew.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:46.900
Kaiju Eugenicists?

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:48.690
How do you know?

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:52.810
They're <i>kaiju</i> users like me,
and I know they'll be back.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:55.150
There's gonna be more <i>kaiju</i> ?

00:04:55.150 --> 00:05:00.650
To get ready for when they come,
you guys need Dynazenon training.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.520
Let's meet up here tomorrow.

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:08.020
Huh? Tomorrow, I dunno...

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:11.060
You guys are fine with it?

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:13.690
If everyone else comes, sure.

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:19.150
Especially you. Promise me
that you'll show up.

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:20.900
Fine.

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:31.270
Dynazenon... Are you a <i>kaiju</i> ?

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:34.940
Why did "that" person trust you with me?

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:39.350
I'm this way.

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:40.400
Right.

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:46.060
Yomogi! You're being tricked!

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:49.060
She's toying with you and tricked you!

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:53.200
Episode 2

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:53.200
What's Your Reason for Fighting?

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:57.730
Whoa! That's sick!

00:05:57.730 --> 00:06:00.020
Which one's the <i>kaiju</i> ?

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:01.190
Both of 'em?

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:03.730
Hey, listen up!

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:10.190
Uh, transportation is a huge mess
because of yesterday's <i>kaiju</i> incident.

00:06:10.190 --> 00:06:13.560
Classes will start with 3rd period today.

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.810
Huh?!

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:18.350
Sensei! Tell us before we leave home!

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:24.350
It just got decided!
And periods will be shorter, so--

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:24.350
Why is our school so slow with
announcements? My friend's school--

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:29.810
Senpai. Training is this evening,
right? Care if I come?

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:31.900
Sure, why not?

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:38.850
Must be nice to get your own robot!
You'll get paid for this, right?

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:40.940
Huh? We get money?

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:42.810
What if you did?

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:48.150
Uh, then that means... I'm employed.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:52.440
Work again, Yomogi?

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:54.230
Yeah. You doing something?

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:57.900
Meat skewers. Kaneishi wants some.

00:06:57.900 --> 00:06:59.520
He's got work.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.900
What a busy bee.

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.650
Sorry. See ya.

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:04.770
Yeah, later.

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:06.520
Bye-bye.

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:09.850
Yomogi's working so much these days.

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:13.150
Does he need money that badly?

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:15.270
He wants to be independent.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:18.160
Dogs must
be leashed!

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:20.900
Wait! Wait!

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:28.770
Put me down!

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:29.980
Gotta go.

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:32.600
That's rare. You got plans?

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:34.020
Oh, wait.

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.100
Hmm?

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:41.350
What the heck?

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.350
Later!

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:51.020
Good grief, that girl...

00:07:56.520 --> 00:08:00.100
Maybe I should've gone to training.

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:02.690
How was your date yesterday?

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:05.690
Believe me, it was anything but that.

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:07.150
Something happen?

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:09.480
Way too much happened.

00:08:11.730 --> 00:08:12.690
Erotically?

00:08:12.690 --> 00:08:14.560
Not erotically.

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:17.730
Oh. She's here.

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:22.270
Oh? You came after all! Atta girl!

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:23.850
Where's Yomogi?!

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:28.230
Huh? He's not coming?!

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:29.730
What are we doing?

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:33.310
I told you already! Pilot training!

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:34.980
Stand out much?

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:37.940
Should we go to the mountains for this?

00:08:37.940 --> 00:08:39.400
Right now?

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:42.190
We can just go in your toys.

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:58.730
It's possible Dynazenon
recognized your aptitude.

00:08:58.730 --> 00:09:00.600
Oh.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:02.310
You were in here? Sorry.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:04.230
Gauma? Why are you here?!

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:05.690
Because you weren't at--

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:07.100
Close the door!

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:08.770
Oh, sorry.

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:10.480
Why'd you come in?

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:17.100
Yomogi. Why didn't you come to training?

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:21.270
You came to my house just to ask me that?

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:24.150
I told you, I had work.

00:09:24.150 --> 00:09:26.900
Is it that important?

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:30.440
I'm finally old enough to work, so...

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:32.150
I see.

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:35.020
Aren't you cramped?

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:36.100
I am.

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:38.480
I told you, it's too small.

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:41.020
Oh? So now it's my fault?

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:42.060
I never--

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:45.650
She's toying with you and tricked you!

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:46.940
Is it true?

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.650
I said I was sorry.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:52.350
Maybe I should just apologize.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:52.350
It didn't sound like you were sorry.

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:55.440
What a good bath!

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:56.810
Mmm.

00:09:56.810 --> 00:09:59.350
Why did you let a stranger inside?

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:01.690
He said he was your friend.

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:05.480
And you just believed him?
Be a little cautious!

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:08.520
I know! Why don't you eat with us?

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:09.900
You're not listening.

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:13.400
Well, I'd hate to intrude
more than I have.

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:17.650
As you can see,
Imose City Hall is a disaster.

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:17.980
Why don't you go sleep, Mom?

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:24.520
It's a six-floor building,
but roughly four floors were torn apart.

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:20.020
Mmm.

00:10:20.020 --> 00:10:22.230
This is incredibly good!

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:23.900
Thank you.

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:27.600
I really appreciate the feast!

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:30.560
There are what appears to be claw marks
from a <i>kaiju</i> on the building.

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:31.100
I know! It's late,
so why don't you sleep over?

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:37.560
To protect city hall,
this tent will be used as disaster HQ.

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:33.150
Huh?! Why?!

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:37.560
Well, I'd hate to intrude more than--

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:55.650
Due to the incident,
this train service has been suspended.

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:57.770
We're very sorry for any--

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:13.520
So it's impossible for Achilles
to catch up to the tortoise.

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:16.730
If Achilles gets here,
he hasn't caught up, yes?

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:18.810
He's here, see? Not caught up.

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:20.350
This paradox is--

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:24.350
You didn't come yesterday.

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:28.190
To training? Yeah, I had work.

00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:31.600
I want you to come with me somewhere.

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:36.480
I guess here works.

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:39.730
I practiced enough to use this now.

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:42.690
Oh, that Dynazenon thing?

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:46.060
Access Mode... Dyna Wing!

00:11:47.900 --> 00:11:50.560
What?! You're kidding!

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:51.850
You, too.

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:53.350
Me?!

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:57.150
Access Mode...

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:00.730
...Dyna Soldier.

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:07.190
Huh?

00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:10.730
Gauma said we should practice this, too.

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:14.400
Whoa! We're floating!

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:25.350
I'm sorry about breaking that promise.

00:12:25.350 --> 00:12:27.600
Why did you do that?

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:31.060
Forget it.

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:32.560
Are you mad?

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:35.520
No. I'm over it.

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:37.190
Sorry.

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:41.230
So, this becomes Dynazenon
if everyone combines?

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:42.850
I think so.

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:46.980
In that case, what's the name
of what we are now?

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:50.400
Its name? No clue.

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:54.770
Dyna... uh, Wing Soldier?

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:02.270
Where to now?

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:05.900
Um, is it this way?

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:12.520
Is this where we fought the other day?

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:13.810
Yeah.

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:18.230
It was dark and I couldn't tell,
but we sure made a mess.

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:19.650
Yeah.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:21.310
Why come here?

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:26.810
I wanted to see it in person.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:35.150
It's only like this
because we fought, right?

00:13:35.150 --> 00:13:39.190
But if we hadn't fought,
I think it would've been worse.

00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:48.980
Think we'll have to keep on fighting?

00:13:48.980 --> 00:13:53.310
Shouldn't we just
hand this off to somebody?

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.020
Somebody?

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:59.350
Like, the nation.
The government or something.

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:03.600
If you always go by the book,
there're things you can't protect.

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:11.480
Yet we go home by train.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:20.560
When I was in elementary school,
my big sister died.

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:21.900
Huh?

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:23.440
By accident.

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:27.230
She died at that flood gate.

00:14:27.230 --> 00:14:30.850
Next stop is Fujiyokidai. Fujiyokidai.

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:34.060
Use the doors on the left. Please remain--

00:14:35.480 --> 00:14:39.100
We've got training today. You coming?

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:41.940
I've got another shift today.

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.810
I see. I'll let the others know.

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:46.770
Thanks. Later.

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:58.690
Whoa! Awesome, Senpai!

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:02.230
He's pretty dang good now,
don't you think?

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:03.690
Sure is.

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:09.020
Great, you came again! What about Yomogi?

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:11.020
He can't make it.

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:13.190
Again?!

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:19.270
Ah, there it is. Those are
some crazy colors.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:21.440
It came surprisingly quick.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:25.480
Maybe it chained well.
Who's gonna get this one?

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:29.150
Seems like a good one for Juuga.

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:30.560
I suppose.

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:32.850
What if that thing interferes?

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:36.310
Leave it to me. I'll show no mercy.

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:40.480
Instance Domination.

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:50.060
<i>Kaiju</i> shall steer the world.

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:50.760
"Dai Jiro to judge the 32nd
Computer Art & Photo Contest"

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:51.930
"[Breaking] Another gigantic <i>kaiju</i> -like
creature discovered in Tokyo."

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:53.480
Look!

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:59.400
Abort! Abort training!

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:02.350
What's the matter?

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:05.440
A <i>kaiju</i> appeared! Let's go!

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:08.310
Yume, can you contact Yomogi?

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:09.810
Contact?

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:14.310
If I go through friends, maybe.

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:21.770
I didn't go to training again, but...

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:24.250
Hello?

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:24.940
Yomogi!

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:27.270
Another <i>kaiju</i> appeared!

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:28.440
A <i>kaiju</i> ?

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:32.020
Without you, we can't fight as Dynazenon!

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:34.440
But I haven't been training.

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:39.980
Don't worry about it. You can just
ride along, but we need you here!

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:41.100
Where are you?!

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.100
Where? Um...

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.600
Forget it. I see you.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:47.100
You do?

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:11.650
I knew it'd show up.

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:16.060
Dynazenon! Battle, Go!

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:28.980
What the hell?! It's too fast!

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:31.690
It's not just fast. It's warping.

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:32.850
Warping?!

00:17:32.850 --> 00:17:35.900
I'm just along for the ride, right?

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:49.400
It's no use! I can't
figure out its movements!

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:50.600
Split up and fight!

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:52.600
--Split up?
--Disperse!

00:17:56.150 --> 00:17:57.900
Um...

00:17:57.900 --> 00:18:02.600
Got it? Fight as three
till I can get a good shot!

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:04.560
Um...

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:05.730
--Okay.
--Got it.
--But I don't really know how to move yet.

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:08.350
--Good! Commence strategy!
--But I don't really know how to move yet.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:19.770
C'mon, Yomogi! Move!

00:18:19.770 --> 00:18:24.230
Sorry! I'm not sure how!

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:23.830
Supervisor

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:23.830
Incoming

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:23.910
Supervisor

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:23.910
Incoming

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:23.990
Supervisor

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:23.990
Incoming

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:24.080
Supervisor

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:24.080
Incoming

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:24.160
Supervisor

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:24.160
Incoming

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:24.240
Supervisor

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:24.240
Incoming

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:27.270
Shoot! It's a call from work!

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:27.250
Supervisor

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:27.250
Incoming

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:29.440
Quick slacking off, Yomogi!

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:32.600
I'm not being useless on purpose!

00:18:36.980 --> 00:18:39.190
Huh? I caught it!

00:18:40.770 --> 00:18:42.060
It's gone.

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:52.060
Shit! And it's all my fault!

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:54.520
Yomogi, it's probably the wings.

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:55.440
Wings?

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:58.230
Before it warps, it spreads its wings.

00:18:58.230 --> 00:19:03.230
Huh? What if I hold it so it can't?

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:08.810
Yomogi, let's try
working together this time.

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:10.060
How?

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:12.940
The thing we did before.

00:19:12.940 --> 00:19:15.190
Let's do it.

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:17.480
Mmm.

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:42.980
Dyna Soldier Wing Combine!

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:49.850
What's the big idea?!

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:52.100
Who cares if you changed form?!

00:19:58.350 --> 00:20:01.310
If I can protect, I will!

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:07.810
Gotcha!

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:10.230
Yomogi, hang on!

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:14.980
What?!

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:18.900
Now!

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:22.230
Toss it, Yomogi!

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:27.980
Dyna Launcher...

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:31.690
...Burst Missile!

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:50.730
Senpai and those guys won again!

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:55.850
We won.

00:20:57.190 --> 00:21:01.270
That's right. We won.

00:21:01.270 --> 00:21:05.600
That was some pretty
sweet teamwork, you three.

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:20.400
Aren't you glad?

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:23.440
We protected it.

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:28.350
Sorry. I held you guys back.

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:30.060
Maybe.

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:34.190
When I was in elementary school,
my big sister died.

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:38.690
Hey, Minami.

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:39.940
What?

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:44.230
Were you fond of your big sister?

00:21:44.230 --> 00:21:50.940
Nah, we didn't get along well.
But I'm not sure anymore.

00:21:55.230 --> 00:22:00.020
I never thought we'd meet again, Gauma.

00:22:04.100 --> 00:22:07.560
I knew it had to be you guys!

00:22:07.560 --> 00:22:09.940
Are those people the...?

00:22:09.940 --> 00:22:14.150
Yeah. The Kaiju Eugenicists.

00:22:14.150 --> 00:22:16.810
<i>Kaiju</i> users like me!
